      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Your fear of being unable to change might be masking a deep hope that someone else must fix you so you don't have to carry the guilt yourself. Leaving isn't the only path to their peace, as healing often begins when you are given a safe space to sit with your own pain before you can finally help them. Asking for help or even allowing someone to care for you is an act of selflessness that makes you a lighter burden rather than a constant anchor.",
